Here is a great way to get out of trouble if you are ever lucky enough to get
a spell book of charm monster. Just wait until you are surrounded by a bunch
of real nasties and cast a spell. All of the sudden they're all on you side.
It's kind of hard to tell who's on you side and who's not, but all you do is
start heading for a safe spot hitting anything in your way. If it's a tame
monster you will just displace it. I think that spells of tame monster are
one of the more power features of the game.
